<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- The go-live banner extension needs no capability: the app holds aps-environment, and the
     extension only edits a push that has already arrived. Without this file xtool gives the
     extension the app's entitlements (and so Push on its App ID). -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
